Here is an example of a standard **`lead.captured`** JSON webhook payload generated when a visitor submits their contact information through the ChatSuite AI widget:

```json
{
  "event": "lead.captured",
  "timestamp": "2026-03-31T12:00:00Z",
  "bot_id": "bot_987654321",
  "data": {
    "lead": {
      "name": "Jane Doe",
      "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
      "phone": "+15551234567"
    },
    "conversation": {
      "session_id": "sess_abc123xyz",
      "user_language": "en",
      "last_message": "Can I book a demo for tomorrow?",
      "summary": "Visitor inquired about platform pricing and requested a demo."
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "source_url": "https://yourwebsite.com/pricing",
    "ip_address": "192.0.2.1"
  }
}
```

